# Everything here is regenerated by `make` or `make cia`. Nothing in this list
# is needed to build the game from a fresh clone - if a file is required as an
# INPUT it must stay tracked, which is why this is a list of specific build
# products rather than a blanket rule on file type. icon.png, cia/banner.png,
# cia/banner.wav and romfs/cacert.pem are all inputs and are deliberately absent
# from it.

# The build tree: objects, dependency files, the linker map and listing, and the
# assembled shader. All of it comes back from `make`.
build/

# Shipped binaries. Built from source/, so keeping them in git only adds a
# megabyte of churn per commit and guarantees binary merge conflicts.
*.3dsx
*.elf
*.smdh
*.cia
*.banner
*.bnr

# Intermediates, in case any ever land outside build/.
*.o
*.d
*.map
*.lst
*.shbin
*_shbin.h

# The update downloads straight into the installer and never stages a file, but
# a manually downloaded one lands here often enough to be worth catching.
modelkit-update.cia

# OS droppings.
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# Python bytecode from running tools/regress.py
__pycache__/
